{"id":"tampoco","lemma":"tampoco","pos":"adv","rank":351,"glosses":["neither; nor; also not","either (as well, with implied negative)"],"ipa":"/tamˈpoko/","order":431,"unit":28,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-tampoco.wav","examples":[{"text":"«No puedo dormir.» «Yo tampoco.»","en":"\"I can't sleep.\" \"Me neither.\"","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642191","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to sleep"},{"g":"I"},null]},{"text":"Yo tampoco sé qué hacer.","en":"I don't know what to do either.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/354869","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"to do"}]},{"text":"No tengo dinero y tampoco tengo amigos.","en":"I don't have any money and I don't have any friends either.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609089","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"money"},{"g":"and"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"friend","l":"amigo"}]}]}